meta {
  name: Simplespace Get Space
  type: http
  seq: 151
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/xrpc/com.atproto.simplespace.getSpace?space=at://{{did}}/space/org.example.bucket/main
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

params:query {
  space: at://{{did}}/space/org.example.bucket/main
}

docs {
  Describe a simplespace space: { uri, policy, appAccess } with the policy and appAccess
  rendered as their lexicon unions ($type). Served by the space host.

  Two credentials reach it: an OAuth/session caller with a "space:…?action=read_self"
  grant who IS the space's authority (400 NotSpaceOwner otherwise), or a DPoP-bound space
  credential for the space (Authorization: DPoP <credential> plus a per-request DPoP proof
  whose "ath" is the credential's hash) — what a member hosted anywhere presents. Bearer
  presentation of a credential is refused.

  Errors: 400 SpaceNotFound (absent, deleted, or a space whose authority lives elsewhere).
}
